erally covariant higher-derivative metric actions ensure dS or AdS backgrounds with no ghost-like or tachyonic states in the perturbative spectrum, including actions with infinitely many derivatives?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0022"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:547503d4a9303155801be18c675983f2b38b52e21447ead5bccc0d0390dbd133","title":"Can fibre inflation admit a globally consistent embedding with chiral D7 matter and closed-string moduli stabilisation while satisfying Kähler-cone bounds, effective-field-theory hierarchies and primordial-perturbation requirements?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0026"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:54a26b94a160f751504f8d5e1638d879b2dce4e3ce9b4528254332685080ad8a","title":"Which eight-dimensional N=1 gauge theories have global gauge anomalies, and which anomalies can be canceled by coupling to topological degrees of freedom? The motivating cases are odd orthogonal groups, F4, G2 and the string-realized Sp(N) theories.","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0026"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:540f2ec882aa53d1ae69298dd0ac0d16432a63d68342fbe01f1153eaa0eea2ee","title":"Which constant-scalar configurations of a four-dimensional gravitational potential describe de Sitter, Minkowski, or anti-de Sitter spacetime? In the paper's action convention, extrema satisfy R4 = 2V and have cosmological constant Λ = V/2.","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0029"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:5493de7ce060b40d214c734c60d57f61eb3bd5fe5b0caa69e09cc252e5013fc0","title":"The analyzed inflationary regime has one canonical light field and uses potential slow-roll parameters to relate quantum-gravity inequalities to tensor production. Monotonic growth of ε lets a lower instantaneous field speed constrain the total fie